{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:49:40+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trine 2: Complete Story", "steam_appid": 35720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1228580], "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Three Heroes </h2></strong>Trine 2 is a sidescrolling game of action, puzzles and platforming where you play as one of three heroes who make their way through dangers untold in a fantastical fairytale world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/c971dfe6af4183562c1f17871421c51c.poster.avif?t=1793622626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/c971dfe6af4183562c1f17871421c51c.webm?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/c971dfe6af4183562c1f17871421c51c.mp4?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join Amadeus the Wizard, Pontius the Knight and Zoya the Thief in their adventure full of friendship, magic and betrayal.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Play together or solo</h2></strong> Twenty levels full of adventure, physics-based puzzles, hazards, enemies and contraptions. Play in single player mode and switch between heroes freely, or bring two friends and play together in local or online co-op.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/3be99a100a623b136c867047adae4fb6.poster.avif?t=1793622626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/3be99a100a623b136c867047adae4fb6.webm?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/3be99a100a623b136c867047adae4fb6.mp4?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trine 2: Complete Story edition</h2></strong>Trine 2: Complete Story fully integrates the main Trine 2 storyline and the Goblin Menace expansion campaign into one mighty fairytale. All owners of Trine 2: Goblin Menace are automatically upgraded to the Complete Story edition.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/61c853bb08f2ff411267ae2fad8455d9.poster.avif?t=1793622626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/61c853bb08f2ff411267ae2fad8455d9.webm?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/61c853bb08f2ff411267ae2fad8455d9.mp4?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20 levels chock-full of adventure, physics-based puzzles, hazards, enemies and contraptions. <br></li><li>3 Heroes – Amadeus the Wizard, Pontius the Knight and Zoya the Thief, each with their own skills – and personalities charming and otherwise.<br></li><li>Choose new skills to aid the heroes in their quest; fight dragon fire with fire arrows or turn your goblin enemies to ice, fly across chasms with the Kitesail Shield, levitate monsters to great heights and then trap them in a box, or slow down the game world with the time-bending gravity bubble!<br></li><li>Travel through beautiful vistas and environments (sometimes using extremely unreliable methods of transportation), including a castle by the treacherous sea, a burning desert, snowy ice mountains, all the way to the insides of a giant worm<br></li><li>Online and local co-op with up to three players.<br></li><li>Save anywhere to play as long or short sessions as you like and use the Unlimited Character Mode and Game+ for additional replay value.<br></li><li>Hidden collectibles for extra adventuring.<br></li><li>Fun and challenging achievements to unlock.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Three Heroes </h2></strong>Trine 2 is a sidescrolling game of action, puzzles and platforming where you play as one of three heroes who make their way through dangers untold in a fantastical fairytale world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/c971dfe6af4183562c1f17871421c51c.poster.avif?t=1793622626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/c971dfe6af4183562c1f17871421c51c.webm?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/c971dfe6af4183562c1f17871421c51c.mp4?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join Amadeus the Wizard, Pontius the Knight and Zoya the Thief in their adventure full of friendship, magic and betrayal.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Play together or solo</h2></strong> Twenty levels full of adventure, physics-based puzzles, hazards, enemies and contraptions. Play in single player mode and switch between heroes freely, or bring two friends and play together in local or online co-op.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/3be99a100a623b136c867047adae4fb6.poster.avif?t=1793622626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/3be99a100a623b136c867047adae4fb6.webm?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/3be99a100a623b136c867047adae4fb6.mp4?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trine 2: Complete Story edition</h2></strong>Trine 2: Complete Story fully integrates the main Trine 2 storyline and the Goblin Menace expansion campaign into one mighty fairytale. All owners of Trine 2: Goblin Menace are automatically upgraded to the Complete Story edition.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/61c853bb08f2ff411267ae2fad8455d9.poster.avif?t=1793622626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/61c853bb08f2ff411267ae2fad8455d9.webm?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/extras/61c853bb08f2ff411267ae2fad8455d9.mp4?t=1793622626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20 levels chock-full of adventure, physics-based puzzles, hazards, enemies and contraptions. <br></li><li>3 Heroes – Amadeus the Wizard, Pontius the Knight and Zoya the Thief, each with their own skills – and personalities charming and otherwise.<br></li><li>Choose new skills to aid the heroes in their quest; fight dragon fire with fire arrows or turn your goblin enemies to ice, fly across chasms with the Kitesail Shield, levitate monsters to great heights and then trap them in a box, or slow down the game world with the time-bending gravity bubble!<br></li><li>Travel through beautiful vistas and environments (sometimes using extremely unreliable methods of transportation), including a castle by the treacherous sea, a burning desert, snowy ice mountains, all the way to the insides of a giant worm<br></li><li>Online and local co-op with up to three players.<br></li><li>Save anywhere to play as long or short sessions as you like and use the Unlimited Character Mode and Game+ for additional replay value.<br></li><li>Hidden collectibles for extra adventuring.<br></li><li>Fun and challenging achievements to unlock.</li></ul>", "short_description": "Three Heroes make their way through a fairytale world of forgotten ruins, scheming goblins and incredible contraptions, featuring physics-based puzzles, beautiful sights and online and local co-op.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Finnish, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Italian, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Czech, Hungarian, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Russian, Turkish, Polish, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/header.jpg?t=1793622626", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/a9e6f349dfbef3d413f72caaf8f228f0449ed8c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793622626", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/a9e6f349dfbef3d413f72caaf8f228f0449ed8c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793622626", "website": "http://www.trine2.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz dual-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4.5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> ATi Radeon HD 2400 or NVIDIA GeForce 7600 or better, with Shader Model 3.0 support. Does not run on the Intel graphics solutions used in 2004-2009; runs on Intel HD Graphics 3000 or better (2010 onwards).<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Sound:</strong> DirectX 9.